    { q: "Do I reset my Apex account inside Tradovate?", a: "No. The reset happens in your Apex Trader Funding member dashboard, under the section listing your evaluation accounts. Tradovate is only the trading platform, so there's no reset button inside it. After the reset clears, you log back in to Tradovate to trade the fresh account." },
